type: software
title: "2D binary Dammann vortex grating"
abstract: "Python code that generates a 2D binary Dammann vortex grating as a phase-only mask for a spatial light modulator (SLM), enabling detection of the orbital angular momentum of optical vortices from l = -24 to +24."
